title: 'pallet-psm: make the issuance check advisory'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Any holder can burn the internal asset outside of the PSM, for example with XCM
      `BurnAsset`. The issuance then falls below the PSM's debt, and the reserve holds the
      difference as surplus. Check 4 of `do_try_state` ("Total internal issuance is less than
      total PSM debt") now writes a warning instead of returning an error.

crates:
  - name: pallet-psm
    bump: patch
